    To: J REDACTED, employee, DL Storage

    From:
    B REDACTED, CEO, DL Storage

    Subject: Facility 72


    Facility 72 information

    Facility
    location: REDACTED

    Facility status: EMERGENCY POWER ONLY, LIFE SUPPORT OFFLINE

    Workforce
    count: 10        Workforce status: UNKNOWN

    Last contact: 2 MONTHS  (Data
    may be invalid)

    FACILITY IS GREENLIT FOR INVESTIGATION, XL-36 INVESTIGATION
    DRONE RECOMMENDED (WARNING: Expect movement lag to due to tempermental signal)


    Objective:
