    and status (A/D)

    WARNING: last transmission suggested bio-chemical leakage
    and unidentified hostiles, procede with caution

    ALPHA-level notice: Under
    no circumstances is any information relating to this investigation to be shared
    with anyone other than the CEO, inside or outside of the company. Failure to
    comply with this directive will result in REDACTED


